in 4446226ea9f835396c16fdfd388dd5e69c6174bc node: Add option to relay txs only if they are added to mempool

```diff
$ git diff
diff --git a/src/node/transaction.cpp b/src/node/transaction.cpp
index 3be8919b16..23d394c7aa 100644
--- a/src/node/transaction.cpp
+++ b/src/node/transaction.cpp
@@ -62,7 +62,8 @@ TransactionError BroadcastTransaction(NodeContext& node, const CTransactionRef t
             // There's already a transaction in the mempool with this txid. Don't
             // try to submit this transaction to the mempool (since it'll be
             // rejected as a TX_CONFLICT), but do attempt to reannounce the mempool
-            // transaction if broadcast_method is not TxBroadcast::MEMPOOL_NO_BROADCAST.
+            // transaction if broadcast_method is not TxBroadcast::MEMPOOL_NO_BROADCAST
+            // or TxBroadcast::MEMPOOL_AND_BROADCAST_ADDED.
             //
             // The mempool transaction may have the same or different witness (and
             // wtxid) as this transaction. Use the mempool's wtxid for reannouncement.

```
